msgstr "光の強さ（1 が既定）"

msgid "Light color"
msgstr "光の色"

msgid "Ambient"
msgstr "環境光"

msgid "The light on the shaded side"
msgstr "影の側の明るさ"

msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

msgid "Reset Scene"
msgstr "シーンを元に戻す"

msgid "The light, the ambient and the background back to the default (the camera stays)"
msgstr "光・環境光・背景を既定に戻す（カメラはそのまま）"

msgid "Scene Settings…"
msgstr "シーンの設定…"

msgid "Only the preview; the scene's lights are not changed."
msgstr "プレビューだけ。シーンのライトは変えません。"
